{"id":14344,"author":"vladthegreat100","body":"\u003cb\u003eSO\u003c/b\u003e. My dad's birthday is coming up and my mom and I want to get a dog for him and we don't know where to get one. We would have gotten one in the earlier years but my dad has anger issues and freaks out on the tiniest things until he figures out he was wrong xd. And we know he loves dogs but due to the anger issue we never got him one. And what is not the best time to get him dog than on his birthday?\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eMy question is, what type of dog would you get? And for what reason. We are hoping to get a small dog at least.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThanks for the help!\u003cbr\u003e-Vlad","body_tagged":"\u003cb\u003eSO\u003c/b\u003e. My dad's birthday is coming up and my mom and I want to get a dog for him and we don't know where to get one. We would have gotten one in the earlier years but my dad has anger issues and freaks out on the tiniest things until he figures out he was wrong xd. And we know he loves dogs but due to the anger issue we never got him one. And what is not the best time to get him dog than on his birthday?\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eMy question is, what type of dog would you get? And for what reason. We are hoping to get a small dog at least.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThanks for the help!\u003cbr\u003e-Vlad","created_at":1434307558,"title":"What type of dog would you get?","replies":[{"id":198769,"author":"SirCyaniide","body":"German Shepard or a Golden Retriever\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e^^^^Keep it classy","body_tagged":"German Shepard or a Golden Retriever\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e^^^^Keep it classy","created_at":1434307825},{"id":198772,"author":"Pelpelajax","body":"It's not particularly small, but it's reall loving and sweet, a Golden Retriever.","body_tagged":"It's not particularly small, but it's reall loving and sweet, a Golden Retriever.","created_at":1434307911},{"id":198773,"author":"Porkyyy","body":"Since I was small, I've always wanted a Dachshund.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eReason:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"http://www.puppyoverload.com/pictures/dachshund-puppy-that-is-cute.jpg\" title=\"Image: http://www.puppyoverload.com/pictures/dachshund-puppy-that-is-cute.jpg\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eEDIT: I also agree with Pelp and Cyanide. They're just adorable. \u0026lt;3","body_tagged":"Since I was small, I've always wanted a Dachshund.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eReason:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"http://www.puppyoverload.com/pictures/dachshund-puppy-that-is-cute.jpg\" title=\"Image: http://www.puppyoverload.com/pictures/dachshund-puppy-that-is-cute.jpg\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eEDIT: I also agree with Pelp and Cyanide. They're just adorable. \u0026lt;3","created_at":1434307982},{"id":198774,"author":"Subscriptor","body":"I would like to have a horse, but anyways.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"http://i.imgur.com/erN5FqG.jpg\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDeal with it.","body_tagged":"I would like to have a horse, but anyways.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"http://i.imgur.com/erN5FqG.jpg\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDeal with it.","created_at":1434308269},{"id":198777,"author":"BoldAndBrash","body":"All of them.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eEDIT: But really, if you want a small one, a dachshund or pug would be nice. If you want something noisy, get a chihuahua.","body_tagged":"All of them.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eEDIT: But really, if you want a small one, a dachshund or pug would be nice. If you want something noisy, get a chihuahua.","created_at":1434308695},{"id":198778,"author":"Vobaseball12","body":"Totally agree. Get a lab or Golden Retriever, both great dogs.","body_tagged":"Totally agree. Get a lab or Golden Retriever, both great dogs.","created_at":1434309111,"reply_to":198772},{"id":198785,"author":"TheColdCrafter","body":"i have one\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003